# Habr Tech Radar — agent context

Before substantial work, skim `project-docs/PRD.md`, `ARCHITECTURE.md`, and `TASKS.md`. Prefer the smallest change that matches the active task; do not refactor unrelated modules.

After a meaningful session, append `project-docs/SESSION_LOG.md`, adjust checkboxes in `project-docs/TASKS.md` if tasks were completed or added, and refresh `project-docs/HANDOFF.md` (current state, how to run, next 2–3 steps).

Stage 2 (comment-draft workflow) is out of scope unless the user explicitly expands scope.
